{# Render ancestral wisdom from deceased JINN workers #}
{% macro render_lessons(lessons, max_lessons=10) %}
### Ancestral Wisdom
{% if lessons %}
These lessons were earned by JINNs who came before:
{% for lesson in (lessons or [])[:max_lessons] %}
- {{ lesson }}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
No ancestral wisdom yet. You are the first.
{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}
